---
description: Keep WharfBar docs and .agent in sync
alwaysApply: true
globs:
  - "**/*.md"
---

# Documentation

- Canonical docs and `README.md` are English.
- The only extra translation is `README.tr.md` (Turkish). Do not add other language READMEs.
- API, type, and config names stay English.
- Code identifiers stay English. Code comments and XML doc comments are English.
- Committed docs, code comments, and UI copy defaults are English-only; Turkish exists only in `Strings.tr.resx` and `README.tr.md`.
- Commit messages may be English or Turkish, short and why-focused.
- `.cursor` rules stay short pointers; do not paste long guides into them.
- Before changing behavior/architecture, read matching `docs/` + `.agent/` files first
- Update `.agent/` and `docs/` in the same change when decisions shift
- Do not paste long technical guides into `.cursor/rules` — link to `docs/` instead
- External notes (e.g. Downloads) are not source of truth; fold content into `docs/`
